1. PlanetSide 2 game content: Daybreak Game Company LLC
   - assets/weapons/*.webp (weapon images, converted from the Daybreak Census
     API image files) and assets/weapons/catalog.json (item names and ids)
   - Daybreak game data in data/ and data-ps/ (character names and ids, stats,
     weapon, map, base and alert data from the Census API and streaming API)
   - assets/site-bg.webp: PlanetSide 2 key art used as the page background
     (copied here so visitors' browsers don't load it from imgur.com)
   - Medal and ribbon artwork used for icons (AuraxHD.png, GAurax.png,
     PlatAurax.jpg, gigaraxium.png, splash-medal.webp, assets/gaurax-footer.webp,
     favicon*.png, apple-touch-icon.png, icon-maskable-512.png) where based on
     in-game art
   PlanetSide and PlanetSide 2 are registered trademarks of Daybreak Game
   Company LLC. This project is not affiliated with, sponsored or endorsed by
   Daybreak Game Company. Use of the Census API follows Daybreak's API policy:
   https://census.daybreakgames.com/

2. Honu (wt.honu.pw) by Varunda: session, kill and experience details used for
   lifetime history, assists and session checks, and the per-alert participant
   lists behind the oracle's outlier reports.

3. PS2Alerts (ps2alerts.com): alert history used to grow and test the oracle's
   prediction trees (oracle-worker/history). The PS2Alerts source code is
   GPL-3.0; no PS2Alerts code is included here.

4. PS2 Radar (ps2radar.com): second-opinion results for flagged players
   (data/radar.json, oracle radar cache).

5. assets/icons/headshot.svg: "Headshot" icon by Lorc (https://game-icons.net),
   Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/).
   Changed: the black background square was removed. Used as the headshot
   mark in the 🎥 live feed.

Runtime dependencies: none. The site loads no third-party scripts, styles or
fonts. Build and test tools (wrangler, cwebp, Playwright) are used only in
GitHub Actions or on a developer machine and are not distributed.

